                                "sense_id": "225479c4-96c3-3173-83c2-fc22c1c2e383",
                                "text": "In the parcels office there were small cooking stoves, asteam with the aroma of boiling rice, set on the desks among the glue pots and brown paper, cardboard boxes of opened parcels."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6811b3a5-37db-3595-82e1-c8b64e3969e6",
