                                "sense_id": "6811b3a5-37db-3595-82e1-c8b64e3969e6",
                                "text": "Sara, her eyeglasses asteam, was stirring a big pot of quahog chowder."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea33688b-4a15-47b7-b5ad-97895fbe08bb",
                                "sense_id": "6811b3a5-37db-3595-82e1-c8b64e3969e6",
                                "text": "“Go ahead!” he screamed, his glasses asteam and opaque. “We can’t read it anyway! Go ahead! Rain on it!”"
